      "content": "i know you're trying to be nice but it's not just \"hurting.\" it's like... the version of me that they liked is dead. and i can't get that person back. i walk into the dining hall and it's like i'm not even in the room. everyone has moved on and i'm just stuck in this loop of being nothing. it feels like there's no version of the future where this isn't my life.",
